OL,3,GNEWSALocal legend Reading Elvis dies
OL,4,Aaged 77
OL,5,
OL,6,FA local legend known to many thousands
OL,7,Fas Reading Elvis has died aged 77.
OL,9,FDavid Allon, a lifelong fan of the King
OL,10,Fof Rock and Roll, was often spotted in
OL,11,FReading town centre with his prized
OL,12,FElvis records or wearing a Presley
OL,13,FT-shirt.
OL,15,FHe turned on the town's Christmas
OL,16,Flights in 2016 and hosted a DJ set at
OL,17,Fthe Readipop festival in 2018.
OL,19,FFriend Trevor Absolom said news of
OL,20,FAllon's death had led to "an
OL,21,Funbelievable outpouring of love and
OL,22,Faffection over the last 24 hours".
